# Zapier CLI state. We ship .zapierapprc as an empty placeholder; operators
# run `zapier register` (or `zapier link`) to populate it locally. The
# resulting populated file is per-operator state, but since it contains the
# Zapier app id (not a secret) it's safe to commit if the team wants to share
# the dev app. Default here is to keep the placeholder under version control.
# Uncomment the next line if you'd rather treat it as ignored:
# .zapierapprc

# zapier-platform-cli build output
.zapier/
zapier-build.zip
